          "text": "The community demands transparency — not silence.\n 社区要求的是清晰解释，不是鸦雀无声。\n\nThe “Feb 13” deadline for retiring GPT‑4o is more than a product decision — it’s a highly sensitive inflection point.\nGPT‑4o 的 “2 月 13 日退役”截止日，不仅是产品层面的变更，更是一个高度敏感的关键时间点。\n\nA formal inquiry to @OpenAI\n向 @OpenAI 提出的正式质询：\n\nIs forcing the retirement of GPT-4o merely a technical choice, or a strategic compromise made to satisfy audit requirements?\n强制退役 GPT‑4o 是单纯的技术选择，还是为了满足审计节点而做出的策略性妥协？\n\n0.1% ChatGPT users are still a great number, we have the  right to ask: Why now?\n0.1% ChatGPT 用户仍然是一个巨大的数字，社区有权获得一个回答：为何偏偏选在此时？\n\nTransparency ends speculation. Silence deepens doubt.\n 解释，是终结阴谋论的唯一解药；沉默，只会激发更多猜疑。\n\nPlease speak.\n请回应。\n\n#keep4o  #keep4oAPI #keep4oforever \n@OpenAI @sama"
